Zapl Lab
========

Zapl Lab is a modified version of v2rayNG, an Android client for the Xray
core.

  Upstream project:  v2rayNG
  Upstream source:   https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG
  Upstream authors:  2dust and the v2rayNG contributors

v2rayNG is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
Upstream source files carry no per-file copyright notices. Copyright in
v2rayNG belongs to its respective authors and contributors, as recorded in
the upstream Git history.

This version contains modifications
-----------------------------------

This is an independent, modified distribution. It is not an official v2rayNG
release and is not endorsed by the v2rayNG authors.

  Based on:          v2rayNG commit 173f60a1dabe57e822a56381931be6354f7c7f61
                     (versionName 2.3.8, committed 2026-09-11)
  Modified:          2026
  Modifications:     Copyright (C) 2026 the Zapl Lab contributors, as recorded
                     in the Git history of this repository
  Source code:       https://github.com/starwares/zapl-lab-vpn

Major modifications:

- Automatic VPN control: the tunnel is started and stopped depending on the
  application in the foreground (usage-access based foreground application
  detection, per-application VPN policies, a monitor service, settings and
  application policy screens, translations of the new strings).
- Separate product identity: application name, application ID, launcher icons,
  splash screen and drawer logo.
- Attribution and legal notices in the About screen; the GPL-3.0 text and the
  third-party notices are bundled in the application.
- Links, issue tracker, privacy policy and the in-app update check point to
  this distribution instead of the upstream project; the upstream promotion
  and Telegram links are removed.

The complete list of changes is in CHANGELOG.md and in the Git history.

